rator-sdk/commit/68e3044f032b5e5ec35abcb38acba78ff9339de8))\n* **tools:** update dependency nuget-license to v4.0.15 ([#1206](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-operator-sdk/issues/1206)) ([711b8a7](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-operator-sdk/commit/711b8a7d30d7a76b1443accb2ae7bf1f0c461953))\n'",
